I have been reading this newsgroup for a while, but I still don't think it
makes any sense.  Nethack is not Hack, and hack still exists!

I realy think that there should be a rec.games.nethack newsgroup and that
rec.games.hack should be left for real hack players.  Try reading
rec.games.rogue, you will see that a lot of people can still share their
interest for an old game while not being invaded with posts from people of
an other world.

Personally I like the three games, and I would subscribe and read the three
newsgroups, but I would again be frustrated if I saw posts about larn,
omega or any other game I still do not play.

If you share my opinion, please post (here!) or create rec.games.nethack
so we can all move and leave rec.games.hack.

And thanks to that guy who sent a hack spoiler, though it is not complete,
it will be helpfull for me and a lot of hackers...


